  <name>Gloop</name>
  <summary>Browse and manage local files</summary>
  <description>
    <p>Gloop is a keyboard-first file manager for Linux and Wayland. Browse local
    files in list or tile views, preview images and text, and navigate with
    bookmarks and optional split panes.</p>
    <p>Create folders, rename files, copy, move, and send files to Trash.
    Customize the theme and keyboard shortcuts in Preferences.</p>
  </description>
